# [[dialect]], [[patois]], [[regionalism]]
# [[pronunciation]], [[accent]]

====Usage notes====
When describing the specific regionalisms of Russian in different places (such as differences between a speaker in Moscow from someone in Donetsk or Omsk), "говор" is used. "{{l|ru|наре́чие}}" is for greater categories, like Northern Russian dialects as opposed to Southern Russian dialects in both Russia and Ukraine.

